He put his face on her ex-husband's face from a family ski trip and sent it out to people.
他把自己的脸P到了她前夫在家庭滑雪旅行的照片上，还发给了别人。

35
00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:45.030
Yeah.
没错。

36
00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:46.050
Oh, Michael.
噢，迈克尔。

37
00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:51.290
Well, Andy suggests he and some of the guys take Michael to Benihana to cheer him up.
安迪建议他和几个男同事带迈克尔去贝尼哈纳餐厅散散心。

38
00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:56.550
Meanwhile, Angela kicks Karen out of the party planning committee.
与此同时，安吉拉把凯伦踢出了派对筹备委员会。

39
00:01:57.050 --> 00:02:02.190
So Pam and Karen band together and start the committee to plan parties.
于是帕姆和凯伦联手，组建了她们自己的派对筹备委员会。

40
00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:04.890
