我们要迎来两场针锋相对的节日派对了。

41
00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:06.650
Oh, she should have had better ideas.
噢，她本该想出更好的点子的。

42
00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:10.470
Oh, boy, you you are in it to win it today.
天哪，你今天真是火力全开啊。

43
00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:11.870
And I came to play.
我是有备而来的。

44
00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:12.710
I came to play.
我是有备而来的。

45
00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:17.870
Well, later, Michael and the boys come back from Benihana with dates just in time for the
后来，迈克尔和男同事们带着约会对象从贝尼哈纳回来，正好赶上

46
00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:19.210
two parties to merge.
两个派对合并。

47
00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:22.970
And we end with everyone singing their hearts out to karaoke.
最后大家都在卡拉OK环节尽情高歌。

48
00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:24.850
All right.
好的。

49
00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:27.910
Fast fact number one, Harold Ramis.
冷知识第一条，哈罗德·雷米斯。

50
00:02:28.070 --> 00:02:29.250
Harold Ramis.
哈罗德·雷米斯。

51
00:02:29.470 --> 00:02:33.210
I mean, Jenna, my whole childhood were his movies.
我的意思是，珍娜，我整个童年都是看他的电影长大的。

52
00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:33.770
Legend.
传奇人物。

53
00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:38.630
I was so giddy, nervous, excited to work with him.
能和他合作，我当时又兴奋又紧张，激动得不得了。

54
00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:46.570
I mean, Meatballs, Caddyshack, Ghostbusters, Ghostbusters 2, Groundhog Day for flippin' sake.
我是说，《肉丸》、《疯狂高尔夫》、《捉鬼敢死队》、《捉鬼敢死队2》，还有《土拨鼠之日》，天哪。

55
00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:47.530
Stripes?
《杂牌军东征》？

56
00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:48.490
Stripes.
《杂牌军东征》。

57
00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:49.130
Oh, my God.
天哪。

58
00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:49.430
Yes.
没错。

59
00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:50.090
Stripes.
《杂牌军东征》。

60
00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:53.670
Oh, also, Angela, he got his start at Chicago's Second City.
哦，对了，安吉拉，他是在芝加哥的“第二城市”剧团出道的。

61
00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:54.250
Yes.
是的。

62
00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:57.010
He's just like so talented.
他真的太有才了。

63
00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:00.050
He's such a great writer as well.
他也是一位非常出色的编剧。

64
00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:02.170
You guys, he's a writer, actor, director.
伙计们，他既是编剧、演员，又是导演。

65
00:03:02.170 --> 00:03:06.050
He was just a comic legend, and I was in awe.
他简直是喜剧界的传奇，我当时对他敬畏不已。

66
00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:08.550
Well, you know, he passed away in 2014.
嗯，你知道，他在2014年去世了。

67
00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:12.990
I just can't believe that I got to work with him, frankly.
坦白说，我简直不敢相信我竟然能和他合作。

68
00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:13.730
I know.
我懂的。

69
00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:16.990
Harold Ramis was just a teddy bear of a human.
哈罗德·雷米斯简直是个像泰迪熊一样温暖的人。

70
00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:21.370
He just made you feel so comfortable, and he was so fun to talk to.
他让你感到非常自在，而且和他聊天特别有趣。

71
00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:24.110
And I have some great memories of him.
我有很多关于他的美好回忆。

72
00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:27.990
We did a lot of conference room scenes, obviously, in this episode.
显然，我们在这一集里拍了很多会议室的戏份。

73
00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:30.270
I was in the conference room quite a bit, right?
我当时在会议室待了不少时间，对吧？

74
00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:33.110
Because my party versus Karen's and Pam's party.
因为那是我的派对和凯伦、帕姆的派对在较劲。

75
00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:33.450
Yeah.
没错。

76
00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:36.870
And Harold was in the conference room with me, and we were just chatting.
哈罗德当时和我一起在会议室里，我们就在那儿聊天。

77
00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:44.050
And he told this great story about how when kids would come trick-or-treating to his house,
他讲了一个很棒的故事，说每当有孩子去他家讨糖果时，

78
00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:45.010
he lived in Illinois.
他当时住在伊利诺伊州。

79
00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:53.090
He would put on the Ghostbusters uniform and answer the door in his Ghostbusters uniform.
他就会穿上《捉鬼敢死队》的制服去开门。

80
00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:55.130
Yeah, he did that every year.
对，他每年都这么做。

81
00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:56.710
I thought that was so delightful.
我觉得这太可爱了。

82
00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.190
It was the sweetest story.
这是最暖心的故事了。

83
00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.510
All right, let's move in to Fast Fact No.
好了，让我们进入第二个冷知识，

84
00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:03.390
2, which I'm calling Guest Star Breakdown.
我把它称为“客串明星大起底”。

85
00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:03.830
Okay.
好的。

86
00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:06.190
We got to break down all of our guest stars.
我们得把所有的客串明星都盘点一下。

87
00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:08.410
The Benihana Waitresses.
红花铁板烧的女服务员们。

88
00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:13.810
The main waitress in the restaurant, Cindy, is played by Brittany Ishibashi,
餐厅里的主要女服务员辛迪由布兰妮·石桥饰演，

89
00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:17.190
who you might recognize from Runaways.
你可能在《离家童盟》里见过她。

90
00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:23.450
She starred as Tina, as well as recurring roles on Hawaii Five-0 and Grace and Frankie.
她饰演了蒂娜，还在《天堂执法者》和《同妻俱乐部》中有过常驻角色。

91
00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:29.710
But here is something very interesting about Brittany and me.
但关于我和布兰妮，有一件非常有意思的事。

92
00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:30.750
What?
什么事？

93
00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:31.710
Okay.
好吧。

94
00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:40.050
Weirdly, both Brittany and I have had guest appearances on the TV shows Off Center and Mismatch,
说来奇怪，我和布兰妮都曾在电视剧《Off Center》和《Mismatch》中客串过，

95
00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:42.630
but we were not in the same episode.
但我们并没有在同一集出现。

96
00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:49.030
So, the office was the third project that she and I have both been in,
所以，《办公室》是我们俩共同参与的第三个项目，

97
00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:51.750
but we've never shared a scene and we've never met.
但我们从来没有同框过，也从来没见过面。

98
00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:53.350
That's crazy.
太疯狂了。

99
00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:56.530
Our lives have sort of been intersecting.
我们的人生轨迹一直在交错。

100
00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:58.210
Brittany, am I going to meet you one day?
布兰妮，我有一天能见到你吗？

101
00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:01.930
You're on track to finally be in a project together at the same time,
你们终于要在同一个项目里合作了，

102
00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:04.050
on the same day, in the same scene.
在同一天，在同一场戏里。

103
00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:06.490
So, Angela, there are two more guest star waitresses.
所以，安吉拉，还有两位客串的女服务员。

104
00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:10.150
These are the waitresses that Michael and Andy bring back to the party.
就是迈克尔和安迪带回派对的那两位服务员。

105
00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:14.270
So, first, there is Amy, who is played by Kat On,
首先是艾米，由凯特·昂饰演，

106
00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:19.610
and she's done just a ton of sketch comedy, stand-up, funny or die.
她演过很多小品喜剧、单口相声，还有Funny or Die的作品。

107
00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:25.710
And then there is Michael's girlfriend, Nikki, who is played by Kulop Vilaisok.
然后是迈克尔的女友妮基，由库洛普·维莱索克饰演。

108
00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:26.250
Okay.
好的。

109
00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:28.890
I worked with Kulop on Hot Wives of Orlando.
我和库洛普合作过《奥兰多辣妻》。

110
00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:30.370
It was the show on Hulu.
那是Hulu上的一档节目。

111
00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:35.010
It's a really funny spoof of The Real Housewives, and she was great in it.
那是对《比弗利娇妻》非常搞笑的恶搞，她在里面表现得很棒。

112
00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:37.910
She's great in a lot of things, but that was a lot of fun to do.
她在很多作品里都很棒，但那次合作真的很有趣。

113
00:05:37.910 --> 00:05:39.790
Well, lady, you know I loved that.
好吧，女士，你知道我喜欢那个。

114
00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:40.850
I know.
我知道。

115
00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:43.090
Okay.
好的。

116
00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:51.230
Fast fact number three, I got the scoop from Kentopedia on the Benihana location,
第三个快讯，我从“肯特百科”那里打听到了关于贝尼哈纳餐厅选址的消息，

117
00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:53.850
because we got a lot of fan questions about it.
因为我们收到了很多粉丝关于此事的提问。

118
00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:59.090
I wanted to ask about that, because I was wondering if it's the Benihana's in Encino.
我正想问这个，因为我在想那是不是恩西诺的那家贝尼哈纳。

119
00:05:59.290 --> 00:05:59.990
It sure is.
确实是。

120
00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:03.390
I have been to that Benihana's, and when I was re-watching this,
我去过那家贝尼哈纳，当我重温这一集时，

121
00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:07.750
the way you walk into the restaurant, you know, it's the same.
你们走进餐厅的方式，你知道，一模一样。

122
00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:09.790
And I was like, yeah, come on.
当时我就想，没错，就是它。

123
00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:12.190
That's Benihana's in Encino, California.
那就是位于加州恩西诺的贝尼哈纳餐厅。

124
00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:17.870
Well, lady, we got some fan questions from Ashley Hildreth, Rachel Martineau,
好吧，女士，我们收到了一些粉丝提问，来自阿什利·希尔德雷斯、雷切尔·马蒂诺、

125
00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:27.090
Hannah Holtman, Malia Holbrook, Abigail Hess, Rupinder Gossel, and many others, all asked,
汉娜·霍尔特曼、马利亚·霍尔布鲁克、阿比盖尔·赫斯、鲁平德·戈塞尔以及许多其他人，他们都问，

126
00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:30.350
were the restaurant scenes filmed at an actual restaurant?
餐厅场景是在真正的餐厅里拍摄的吗？

127
00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:32.610
How long did it have to be shut down?
它需要停业多久？

128
00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:36.290
And is the chef at Benihana an actual Benihana chef?
而且贝尼哈纳的厨师是真正的贝尼哈纳厨师吗？

129
00:06:36.550 --> 00:06:38.110
Or was it an actor?
还是演员演的？

130
00:06:38.110 --> 00:06:41.130
I'm going to say yes, because he was too good with that knife.
我猜是真正的厨师，因为他玩刀的技术太好了。

131
00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:42.870
Yes, we will start there.
没错，我们就从这里开始说起。

132
00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:44.210
It was a real chef.
那是位真正的厨师。

133
00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:53.190
We hired all of the chefs and all of the waitstaff of the Encino Benihana to perform in the episode.
我们雇佣了恩西诺贝尼哈纳所有的厨师和服务员来参与这一集的拍摄。

134
00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:57.850
And we also hired 78 background actors to play diners.
我们还雇了78名临时演员来扮演食客。

135
00:06:58.110 --> 00:07:00.530
We shut it down for a whole day.
我们让它停业了一整天。

136
00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:02.850
We rented out the entire place.
我们包下了整个场地。

137
00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:05.850
And it took about 12 hours to shoot those scenes.
拍摄这些场景大约花了12个小时。

138
00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:12.170
Um, this is reminding me that we had a bigger budget, because when in the past could we go in
嗯，这提醒了我，当时我们的预算比较充足，因为过去我们什么时候能做到

139
00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:13.770
and be like, we'll take the whole place?
直接说我们要包下整个场地呢？

140
00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:18.570
I mean, even Chili's was like an out of business, boarded up.
我的意思是，就连那家“辣椒餐厅”当时也是倒闭、封板的状态。

141
00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:20.010
Yes, that's right.
是的，没错。

142
00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:20.910
Restaurant.
那家餐厅。

143
00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:26.470
